  * Hourly Burn: $10 \times \$150.00 = \mathbf{\$1,500.00/\text{hr}}$
* **Shift 2 Total Hourly Burn Rate:** $\$25 + \$1,500 = \mathbf{\$1,525.00/\text{hr}}$

