## 14. Cost & Capacity Matrix: What is Calculated Hourly vs. Daily

| Entity | Metric | Hourly Calculated? | Daily Calculated? | Formula / Source |
| :--- | :--- | :---: | :---: | :--- |
| **Machine** | **Capacity** | ✅ Yes | ✅ Yes | Hourly = Rated Cap/hr; Daily = $\text{Cap/hr} \times \text{Section Unique Operating Hours}$. |
| **Machine** | **Operating Cost** | ✅ Yes | ✅ Yes | **Hourly:** Consumption $\times$ Rate (or flat hourly for 'Others').<br>**Daily:** $\text{Hourly Operating Cost} \times \text{Section Unique Operating Hours}$. |
| **Manual Batch** | **Capacity** | ✅ Yes | ✅ Yes | Hourly = Batch Rate/hr; Daily = $\text{Batch Rate} \times \text{Shift Effective Hours}$. |
| **Section** | **Capacity** | ✅ Yes | ✅ Yes | **Hourly:** $\sum \text{Machines Cap/hr} + \sum \text{Manual Batches Cap/hr}$<br>**Daily:** $\sum \text{Machine Daily Cap} + \sum \text{Manual Batch Daily Cap}$ |
| **Section** | **Labor Cost** | ✅ Yes | ✅ Yes | **Daily:** Sum across timeline interval slices (exact cost).<br>**Hourly:** $\text{Average Hourly} = \frac{\text{Total Daily Labor Cost}}{\text{Section Operating Hours}}$<br>*(Peak hourly rate during overlap is captured in JSON).* |
| **Section** | **Machine Cost**| ✅ Yes | ✅ Yes | **Hourly:** $\sum \text{Machine Hourly Operating Costs}$<br>**Daily:** $\sum \text{Machine Daily Operating Costs}$ |
| **Section** | **Total Operating Cost**| ✅ Yes | ✅ Yes | **Daily:** $\text{Labor Daily Cost} + \text{Machine Daily Cost}$<br>**Hourly:** $\frac{\text{Total Section Daily Cost}}{\text{Section Operating Hours}}$ |
| **Work Center** | **Capacity** | ✅ Yes | ✅ Yes | **Hourly:** $\sum \text{All Sections' Hourly Capacities}$<br>**Daily:** $\sum \text{All Sections' Daily Capacities}$<br>*(Efficiency % is excluded for now).* |
| **Work Center** | **Labor Cost** | ✅ Yes | ✅ Yes | **Daily:** $\sum \text{Section Daily Labor Costs} + \sum \text{WC Unassigned Staff Daily Costs}$<br>**Hourly:** $\frac{\text{WC Total Daily Labor Cost}}{\text{WC Unique Operating Hours}}$ |
| **Work Center** | **Machine Cost**| ✅ Yes | ✅ Yes | **Daily:** $\sum \text{Section Daily Machine Costs}$<br>**Hourly:** $\frac{\text{WC Total Daily Machine Cost}}{\text{WC Unique Operating Hours}}$ |
| **Work Center** | **Overhead** | ❌ No | ✅ Yes | Direct flat amount entered in the Work Center form. |
| **Work Center** | **Total Operating Cost**| ✅ Yes | ✅ Yes | **Daily:** $\text{WC Labor Daily} + \text{WC Machine Daily} + \text{Overhead Cost}$<br>**Hourly:** $\frac{\text{WC Total Daily Operating Cost}}{\text{WC Unique Operating Hours}}$ |

